  "description": "Ridge Rider 2 is your all-terrain adventure companion: a confidence-inspiring e-bike built to handle everything from neighborhood streets to dirt trails and campground roads. The upright riding position and wide, grippy tires create a smooth, stable ride that feels comfortable and in control whether you’re exploring off-road or cruising through town.\n\nThe powerful electric assist helps flatten hills and extend every ride, giving you the freedom to go farther with less effort. Pedego e-bikes use safe and reliable battery packs certified to UL 2271, and the complete system meets UL 2849 standards, the gold standard for electrical and fire safety, because you and your family deserve peace of mind on every ride. While many e-bike brands skip this step, Pedego puts safety first so your only job is to enjoy the adventure.",
